                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d899a3a8-6cc2-3a81-b278-262c73afe212",
                        "entry_id": "9d879214-2a9d-31c0-b838-6dc647f31f3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Abweichung bezogen auf eine Zeitspanne, in der etwas existiert"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1bd4308-7fca-4584-a115-eca5a52f7f42",
                                "sense_id": "d899a3a8-6cc2-3a81-b278-262c73afe212",
                                "text": "Der Altersunterschied zwischen den beiden betrug 5 Jahre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b53e2e1-6f36-4388-bfbd-d51f107ddee6",
                                "sense_id": "d899a3a8-6cc2-3a81-b278-262c73afe212",
                                "text": "„So hatte ich wegen des Altersunterschieds zwischen uns Geschwistern keine rechte gleichaltrige Gesellschaft.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c19bb848-0ebe-4234-a5ef-3c92a56d36a2",
                                "sense_id": "d899a3a8-6cc2-3a81-b278-262c73afe212",
                                "text": "„Die meisten Menschen finden diesen gewaltigen Altersunterschied abstoßend, doch gerade ihn findet Consuela besonders attraktiv.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f30bf64-5dc1-4c1b-b2a2-7cdd8a2d996f",
                                "sense_id": "d899a3a8-6cc2-3a81-b278-262c73afe212",
                                "text": "„Der Altersunterschied zwischen Mutter und Sohn machte sich kaum bemerkbar.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "120011f1-8946-49da-9b20-20c69f8d00b2",
                                "sense_id": "d899a3a8-6cc2-3a81-b278-262c73afe212",
                                "text": "„Der Altersunterschied wirkt sich zunächst nur darin aus, dass sie etwas auf ihn aufpassen muss und gelegentlich einen Wissensvorsprung hat – etwas weiß, was für ihn wichtig wird, wie die Geschichte mit Elias und dem feurigen Wagen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b1915e6a-f359-4ede-b0d9-9284936aa99b",
                        "source_entry_id": "9d879214-2a9d-31c0-b838-6dc647f31f3f",
                        "source_sense_id": "d899a3a8-6cc2-3a81-b278-262c73afe212",
                        "source_sense_description": "Abweichung bezogen auf eine Zeitspanne, in der etwas existiert",
                        "target_lang_word": "age difference",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "age difference",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75f35265-1e3b-34c7-9f7f-fd768f68c74e",
                                        "entry_id": "71819b40-0fff-376f-a656-3790cd452975",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A difference in ages between two or more people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d0a446d-cfd9-444e-b861-96ee7607a246",
                                                "sense_id": "75f35265-1e3b-34c7-9f7f-fd768f68c74e",
                                                "text": "I suppose the reason so many Snapefic writers pair him up with Hermione is that she's really the only choice unless you're going to introduce an original character. In the long run, I don't see the age difference being a problem because of how long wizards live. In the short run, yeah, I could see Snape getting frustrated rather often with being the only adult in the relationship."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88eeb671-b1c0-4f52-b4fc-7fc7dc3da030",
                                                "sense_id": "75f35265-1e3b-34c7-9f7f-fd768f68c74e",
                                                "text": "One study found second-borns to be lower in self-esteem than firstborns or last-borns, particularly if the age difference between them and the other siblings was approximately 2 years"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05e6c7a6-3a6a-4771-a6d7-b9e4dbd43b4a",
                                                "sense_id": "75f35265-1e3b-34c7-9f7f-fd768f68c74e",
                                                "text": "I understand that once she has found a regular relationship, no matter the age difference, ,^([sic]) she's no longer a cougar. I'm not sure if a regular booty-call partner is enough of a relationship to break her cougarness. However, the best definition, I believe, is a cougar (as any wild cat) is on the prowl for fresh (young) meat!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
